*** Comments ***
    DATA-DRIVEN VALUES TEMPLATE. Copy to src/resource/data_driven/<<resource-group>>/<<resource-group>>_driven.resource.
    Holds the negative/boundary values TEST files reference by name. Every value here must trace back to
    a real constraint (an enum list, a min/max, a required-field rule) in the target's own spec/design —
    never an arbitrary guess (`agent/IMPLEMENTATION.md` Step 3). Naming convention:
    ${<<operation>>_<<what's wrong>>} — e.g. ${get_widget_by_id_invalid_id}, ${post_widget_invalid_status}.
